      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Lili, you’re back! Your boyfriend is downstairs waiting for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：他不是我的男朋友了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：他不是我的男朋友了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì tā bú shì wǒ de nán péng you le",
