      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: He isn’t my boyfriend anymore."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小雨：怎么会这样？你们分手了？",
      "traditional": "小雨：怎麼會這樣？你們分手了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ zěn me huì zhè yàng nǐ men fēn shǒu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: How could this be? Did you two break up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：嗯。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：嗯。",
