      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Yeah."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小雨：为什么？",
      "traditional": "小雨：為什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ wèi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我累了。他每天都在加班，我们见面的时间太少了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我累了。他每天都在加班，我們見面的時間太少了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ lèi le tā měi tiān dōu zài jiā bān wǒ men jiàn miàn de shí jiān tài shǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "他工作忙我知道，我可以等。但是上周，他骗了我。",
      "traditional": "他工作忙我知道，我可以等。但是上周，他騙了我。",
      "pinyin": "tā gōng zuò máng wǒ zhī dào wǒ kě yǐ děng dàn shì shàng zhōu tā piàn le wǒ",
      "english": "Lili: I’m tired. He works overtime every day. We spend too little time together."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "我们说好要一起去吃饭的，他说他要加班，不能去。但是，他没有在加班。",
      "traditional": "我們說好要一起去吃飯的，他說他要加班，不能去。但是，他沒有在加班。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men shuō hǎo yào yì qǐ qù chī fàn de tā shuō tā yào jiā bān bù néng qù dàn shì tā méi yǒu zài jiā bān",
      "english": "I know that he is busy with work, and I can wait. But last week, he cheated me."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "本看到他和一个女孩在一起吃饭，他们还买了很多东西。",
      "traditional": "本看到他和一個女孩在一起吃飯，他們還買了很多東西。",
      "pinyin": "běn kàn dào tā hé yí ge nǚ hái zài yī qǐ chī fàn tā men hái mǎi le hěn duō dōng xi",
      "english": "We agreed to go out to eat together. He said he had to work overtime and couldn’t go. But, he wasn’t working overtime."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben saw him and a girl eating together. They had even bought a lot of stuff."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "小雨：怎么会这样？他太过分了！丽丽，别难过，你会找到更好的男朋友。",
      "traditional": "小雨：怎麼會這樣？他太過分了！麗麗，別難過，你會找到更好的男朋友。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ zěn me huì zhè yàng tā tài guò fèn le lì lì bié nán guò nǐ huì zhǎo dào gèng hǎo de nán péng you",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: How could this be? That’s outrageous! Lili, don’t be sad. You will find an even better boyfriend."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "丽丽：谢谢你，小雨！我已经好很多了，我觉得一个人也很好。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：謝謝你，小雨！我已經好很多了，我覺得一個人也很好。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì xiè xie nǐ xiǎo yǔ wǒ yǐ jīng hǎo hěn duō le wǒ jué de yí ge rén yě hěn hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Thank you, Little Yu! I am already much better. I think that being single is also quite good."
    }
