    "sentence_translations": [
      "That’s Outrageous!",
      "",
      "Little Yu: Lili, you’re back! Your boyfriend is downstairs waiting for you.",
      "",
      "Lili: He isn’t my boyfriend anymore.",
      "",
      "Little Yu: How could this be? Did you two break up?",
      "",
      "Lili: Yeah.",
      "",
      "Little Yu: Why?",
      "",
      "Lili: I’m tired. He works overtime every day. We spend too little time together.",
      "I know that he is busy with work, and I can wait. But last week, he cheated me.",
      "We agreed to go out to eat together. He said he had to work overtime and couldn’t go. But, he wasn’t working overtime.",
      "Ben saw him and a girl eating together. They had even bought a lot of stuff.",
      "",
      "Little Yu: How could this be? That’s outrageous! Lili, don’t be sad. You will find an even better boyfriend.",
      "",
      "Lili: Thank you, Little Yu! I am already much better. I think that being single is also quite good.",
      ""
    ]
